# StagOS HUD color scheme for Plasma (installed to ~/.local/share/color-schemes, copied into
# kdeglobals by stag-plasma-apply). Palette: bg #0a0a0a, surface #111111, hairline #2a2a2a,
# accent #c8102e, text #f0f0f0, dim #8a8a8a. Flat: no gradients, no glow.
